  narrativeGranted: "Iain Schweblin is a middle-aged man. He has a long face that
    leads down to a thin, but well trimmed beard. He wears thick, tortoise shell
    glasses, hooked on large ears. Started balding early so, to save himself the
    trouble, he went bald at the age of 26. He hasn\u2019t grown it out since.  "
